# <type>: <summary in the present tense, no trailing period>
#
# type: feat | fix | chore | docs | test | refactor | build
#
# Keep the summary under 72 characters. Say what changed and why, not how.
#
# Trunk-based rules:
#   - main is always releasable. If this commit breaks it, do not push it.
#   - Small and often beats big and rare. A commit a day keeps rebases short.
#   - Unfinished work goes behind a flag, not on a long-lived branch.
